1
00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:42,700
The young master of the Shangguan family

2
00:00:42,700 --> 00:00:44,700
has the exact symptoms
Senior Medical Maniac taught me about.

3
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:46,300
He is poisoned by Qilixiang.

4
00:00:46,430 --> 00:00:48,960
Fortunately,
I know how to make the antidote.

5
00:00:50,260 --> 00:00:52,520
But we are missing a key ingredient here.

6
00:00:52,700 --> 00:00:55,100
Where can I find the blood
of a divine beast?

7
00:00:57,260 --> 00:00:58,300
That's simple.

8
00:00:58,760 --> 00:01:01,220
You just need to take a drop
of your own blood.

9
00:01:01,660 --> 00:01:03,100
I am not a divine beast.

10
00:01:04,430 --> 00:01:05,560
Trust me.

11
00:01:05,900 --> 00:01:07,300
You'll know once you try.

12
00:01:08,700 --> 00:01:11,630
The young master is awake!
The young master is awake!

13
00:01:17,360 --> 00:01:19,460
My blood actually worked.

14
00:01:20,060 --> 00:01:22,430
Who exactly am I?

15
00:01:26,700 --> 00:01:28,230
Master Shangguan actually

16
00:01:28,230 --> 00:01:30,090
gave me a new residence directly.

17
00:01:39,900 --> 00:01:41,259
I have my own home now.

18
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:44,300
But

19
00:01:44,600 --> 00:01:46,759
I am the only one at home.

20
00:01:57,160 --> 00:01:58,300
This is...

21
00:02:11,500 --> 00:02:13,100
Meet me outside the city gate

22
00:02:13,200 --> 00:02:14,330
at Hai hour tonight.

23
00:02:21,930 --> 00:02:22,860
Is anyone there?

24
00:02:23,260 --> 00:02:24,500
Who wrote this note?

25
00:02:31,460 --> 00:02:32,260
Orchids.

26
00:02:34,230 --> 00:02:35,500
Lady Feng Qingwu.

27
00:02:35,760 --> 00:02:37,200
Among the people I know,

28
00:02:37,200 --> 00:02:38,760
only you have the scent of orchids.

29
00:02:38,760 --> 00:02:39,630
Come out.

30
00:02:44,829 --> 00:02:46,100
You are quite smart.

31
00:02:46,660 --> 00:02:48,460
It saves me from beating around the bush.

32
00:02:48,460 --> 00:02:50,300
There is nothing else.

33
00:02:51,600 --> 00:02:53,200
I called you here

34
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:56,660
just to kill you.

35
00:02:58,600 --> 00:03:00,660
I have already left Mister.

36
00:03:01,060 --> 00:03:02,790
Why do you still hate me so much?

37
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:08,660
Who knows what kind of potion
you gave the Chief?

38
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:10,600
After you left, he went crazy

39
00:03:10,600 --> 00:03:12,930
and had everyone look for you everywhere.

40
00:03:14,500 --> 00:03:16,730
M-Mister...

41
00:03:17,600 --> 00:03:18,600
Die!

42
00:03:39,860 --> 00:03:40,600
Chief!

43
00:03:41,329 --> 00:03:43,200
I found her on your orders,

44
00:03:43,530 --> 00:03:45,300
but she tried to kill me to silence me.

45
00:03:45,300 --> 00:03:46,700
I was just fighting back.

46
00:03:46,860 --> 00:03:48,320
She is twisting the truth.

47
00:03:48,660 --> 00:03:49,930
But Mister will definitely choose

48
00:03:49,930 --> 00:03:51,660
to believe his fiancée, right?

49
00:03:55,460 --> 00:03:56,260
Ah!

50
00:03:56,530 --> 00:03:57,530
Come back with me.

51
00:03:58,200 --> 00:03:59,000
Ah!

52
00:04:01,500 --> 00:04:02,300
What?

53
00:04:04,530 --> 00:04:05,630
Say it again.

54
00:04:06,430 --> 00:04:08,090
I want you to come back with me.

55
00:04:09,430 --> 00:04:12,260
He already consummated his relationship
with Feng Qingwu,

56
00:04:12,260 --> 00:04:14,390
yet he still asks me to go back with him?

57
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:19,000
Young Master Yan.

58
00:04:19,230 --> 00:04:20,560
I won't go back with you.

59
00:04:20,860 --> 00:04:22,960
We are just strangers after all.

60
00:04:22,960 --> 00:04:25,020
What nonsense are you talking about?

61
00:04:33,330 --> 00:04:34,130
Mister!

62
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:35,159
Chief!

63
00:04:50,900 --> 00:04:53,100
Madam, you are finally back.

64
00:04:53,159 --> 00:04:56,900
The Chief has been looking for you everywhere
without eating or drinking these days.

65
00:04:56,900 --> 00:04:58,130
Stop lying to me.

66
00:04:58,860 --> 00:05:00,260
I already know.

67
00:05:00,330 --> 00:05:03,990
He and Feng Qingwu have already
consummated their relationship.

68
00:05:05,030 --> 00:05:06,600
Feng Qingwu is best at illusions.

69
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:08,530
You must have been deceived by her.

70
00:05:08,700 --> 00:05:09,660
Other than you,

71
00:05:09,860 --> 00:05:12,730
the Chief has never fallen for any woman
in a thousand years.

72
00:05:12,730 --> 00:05:15,700
So I misunderstood Mister?

73
00:05:16,300 --> 00:05:18,100
He was so anxious after I left.

74
00:05:18,660 --> 00:05:20,400
Does he really like me?

75
00:05:26,730 --> 00:05:28,860
This girl said she was going
to brew medicine,

76
00:05:28,860 --> 00:05:30,720
but ended up falling asleep here.

77
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:48,730
Mister, why do you have to have a fiancée?

78
00:05:49,100 --> 00:05:50,330
So annoying.

79
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:52,460
Silly girl.

80
00:05:52,830 --> 00:05:55,260
I don't have any marriage contract
with Feng Qingwu.

81
00:05:55,260 --> 00:05:56,260
Not now,

82
00:05:56,260 --> 00:05:57,500
and not ever.

83
00:06:00,800 --> 00:06:01,400
Girl,

84
00:06:02,030 --> 00:06:02,660
let go.

85
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:05,560
No, I want you to sleep with me.
